  "question": {
    "text": "<p>A certain quantity of real gas occupies a volume of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>15</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>dm</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></math>&nbsp;at <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>100</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>atm</mi></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>500</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi></math> when its compressibility factor is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>07</mn><mo>.</mo></math> Its volume at <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>300</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>atm</mi></math>&nbsp;and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>300</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi></math> (When its compressibility factor is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>4</mn></math>) is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>_</mi><mi>_</mi><mi>_</mi><mi>_</mi><mi>_</mi><mi>_</mi><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mi>dm</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></math>(Nearest integer)</p>"
  },
  "options": [],
  "correct_answer": "392",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>The compressibility factor (Z) is given&nbsp;as:</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Z</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>PV</mi></mrow><mi>nRT</mi></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>PV</mi><mi>ZRT</mi></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Z</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>07</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>100</mn><mi>atm</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>15</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>500</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"/><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Z</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>300</mn><mi>atm</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>?</mo><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>300</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Z</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Z</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>&#215;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>&#215;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>07</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>100</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>15</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>300</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>500</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>300</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>03925</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>dm</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></math></p>"
